---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
const updated = 'October 26, 2026';
---

<PageLayout title="Disclaimer" eyebrow="Legal" updated={updated} description="What our guides are, and what they are not.">
	<p>
		The information on {SITE.url} is published in good faith for general information only. We aim to keep it accurate and up
		to date, but platforms like Google change often, so details may become outdated.
	</p>

	<h2>Not professional advice</h2>
	<p>
		Our guides are not legal, financial, tax or other professional advice. For decisions that carry legal or financial risk,
		please speak with a qualified professional.
	</p>

	<h2>No guaranteed results</h2>
	<p>
		Rankings, traffic, leads and sales depend on many factors outside our control, including your market, competition and
		Google's algorithms. Following our advice does not guarantee any specific result.
	</p>

	<h2>Third party tools</h2>
	<p>
		We mention and review third party tools and services. Prices, features and terms can change at any time. Always confirm the
		current details on the provider's website before you buy.
	</p>

	<h2>Affiliate links and ads</h2>
	<p>
		The Site shows ads and contains affiliate links. See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a> and
		<a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> for details.
	</p>

	<h2>Trademarks</h2>
	<p>Product names and brands mentioned on the Site belong to their owners. Mentioning them does not imply endorsement by or affiliation with those companies.</p>
</PageLayout>
